### 创建新版出库订单（createOrder）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-outbound/operations/createOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"sellerFulfillmentOrderId":"ORDER-001","displayableOrderId":"ORDER-001","displayableOrderDate":"2026-08-08T08:00:00Z","displayableOrderComment":"Outbound order","shippingSpeedCategory":"Standard","destinationAddress":{"name":"Customer","addressLine1":"1 Main St","city":"Seattle","state":"WA","country":"US","postalCode":"98101"},"items":[]}}

### 查询新版出库订单（getOrder）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-outbound/operations/getOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"orderId":"ORDER-001"}}

### 查询旧版出库订单（getFulfillmentOrder）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fulfillment-outbound/operations/getFulfillmentOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"sellerFulfillmentOrderId":"ORDER-001"}}
